{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026cu1t3ayOYM1794866968.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>天氣概況：一股偏東氣流正影響廣東沿岸。</p><p></p><p>本港地區今日天氣預測：大致多雲，初時有一兩陣微雨。日間部分時間有陽光，最高氣溫約27度。吹和緩東至東南風，初時離岸風勢間中清勁。</p><p></p><p>展望：明日稍後轉吹偏北風，雲量增多，晚上氣溫下降。隨後一兩日顯著轉涼，星期五及星期六市區最低氣溫在15、16度左右，新界相當清涼。</p><p></p><p>05:45 更新</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T23:04:49.729551+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":159,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T22:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T00:38:47.989464+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T22:58:05.334472+00:00","content_hash":"6d15e418f7c9fe2552f7f879782df9e457ae7b14f324476ac4278e6d294a80ba","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T23:04:49.729551+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}